@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontColor #1e293b
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam arrowColor #3b82f6
skinparam arrowThickness 2

title Nagle 卡顿 vs TCP_NODELAY 管线化: 同一条解密链的两种时序

participant "解密客户端\n(Python)" as C #f1f5f9
participant "aria 解密服务\n(FairPlay, :47010)" as A #fecaca

== Phase 0: 逐样本同步, 被 Nagle 拖垮 (193s) ==

loop 4346 个 sample, 逐个串行
  C -> A : 4B 长度头 (小包)
  note over C, A #fecaca
    Nagle 扣住小尾包 (前序数据未 ACK)
    对端 delayed ACK 压着不回, 等捎带
    => 双方互等 ~40ms (TCP_DELACK_MIN)
  end note
  C -> A : 密文 (定时器超时后才发出)
  A -> C : 明文
end

note over C, A #fecaca
  **每 sample ≈ 44ms × 4346 ≈ 193s, 吞吐仅 0.3 MB/s**
end note

== Phase 1-2: TCP_NODELAY + 双线程管线化 (3.4s) ==

note over C #dcfce7
  writer 线程: 关 Nagle (TCP_NODELAY)
  不等回复连续发, semaphore 限深 64
end note
C ->> A : len + 密文 #1
C ->> A : len + 密文 #2
C ->> A : len + 密文 #3 ...
note over A #dcfce7
  全双工: 发送与接收重叠
  reader 线程独立接收明文
end note
A -->> C : 明文 #1
A -->> C : 明文 #2
A -->> C : 明文 #3 ...

note over C, A #dcfce7
  **57x: 193s -> 3.4s, 吞吐 0.3 -> 18.1 MB/s**
end note

@enduml
